    "title": "iParkit Garage Parking",
    "description": "If you're headed downtown, let us make your parking experience a breeze. \r\n \r\niParkit lets you pay as go for parking in Atlanta, Baltimore, Boston, Chicago, Cleveland, Indianapolis, Milwaukee, Minneapolis, Philadelphia, Pittsburgh, Savannah, San Antonio, St. Louis and Washington DC. We offer great rates at some of the most convenient locations for downtown parking. We own all the garages where iParkit is used, so we're committed to great customer service. \r\n \r\nYou can also pre-pay for reservations at any iParkit location.",
